<title>SWEDEN: Average yield 4.09 pct Sweden 1-wk T-bill auction.</title>
<headline>Average yield 4.09 pct Sweden 1-wk T-bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office on Tuesday said the weighted average yield on an auction of 13 billion crowns worth of seven-day T-bills was 4.09 percent.  </p>
<p>The office announced the unscheduled auction early Tuesday.</p>
<p>The paper will mature on January 15.</p>
<p>A spokesman from the debt office said unscheduled T-bill auctions are held from time to time to cover additional short-term borrowing needs.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
